"""Compiler and linker warnings in first-party code are errors.

See docs/adr/0018-treat-first-party-warnings-as-errors.md. This applies to
every package in this repository and to none of its external dependencies.
--features=-treat_warnings_as_errors on the command line turns it off for a
local build only; never commit an opt-out.
"""

repo(features = ["treat_warnings_as_errors"])
